Upstream project
----------------
    AutocompleteMenu
    https://github.com/ekapiuk/AutoCompleteMenu
    Author: Pavel Torgashov (and contributors)

    The files in this directory are an embedded copy of that project. They are not covered by
    the MIT license at the repository root, which applies only to the RedisGuiManager sources
    outside this directory.

Why this matters
----------------
    RedisGuiManager as a whole is MIT licensed, but it links against this LGPLv3 component.
    Distributing the combined work therefore requires that:

      1. This notice and the full LGPLv3 text are shipped with every distribution
         (RedisGuiManager-THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and AutocompleteMenu/LICENSE).
      2. Recipients can replace this component with a modified version. The AutocompleteMenu
         sources are part of the distributed package for exactly that reason, so the
         component can be swapped without rebuilding RedisGuiManager from this repository.

