Modifications
-------------
    Local modifications made for this project, if any, are noted in README.md in this
    directory. The embedded copy is kept buildable inside this solution
    (see AutocompleteMenu.csproj) rather than consumed as a NuGet package so the sources
    remain available for relicensing or replacement.